TextField(value:format:) tells SkipUI it formats a value, so the field keeps the typed text while it has focus ("7.", an emptied field, "1.2" in a whole-number format) and shows and writes back the formatted value when focus leaves; needs skip-ui 0010. Proposed upstream.

